 @param _capitalRaiseDuration How long the capital raise fee is active in seconds
 @param _teamClaimAddress Where accumulated USDL is claimed to
 @param _feeAccumulator FeeAccumulator contract address

@title MaxWalletOptical
 @notice Enforces maximum token holding percentage per wallet after buy swaps.
 @dev Uses the token transfer callback for pool outputs. Bytecode and cap immutable; owner may change exemptions.
      Pool address is exempt (it holds the liquidity).
      Only checks on buys — sells naturally reduce holdings.

@param _poolRegistry PoolRegistry address for pool validation
 @param _owner Deployer/owner address
 @param _maxWalletBps Maximum holding in bps of total supply

@title TaxOptical
 @notice Applies additional configurable buy/sell tax via beforeSwap amountDelta.
 @dev Uses beforeSwap hook. Tax is taken by reducing the effective amountIn
      (negative amountDelta). The taxed portion remains in the pool, effectively
      benefiting liquidity. Configurable separate buy/sell rates, capped at 10%.
      Immutable once deployed — rates are set at construction.

@param _poolRegistry PoolRegistry address for pool validation
 @param _owner Deployer/owner address
 @param _buyTaxBps Buy tax in basis points (max 1000 = 10%)
 @param _sellTaxBps Sell tax in basis points (max 1000 = 10%)

@title FeesRouter
 @notice NFT-holder interface for fee management.
