@title ProtocolConfig
 @notice Single source of truth for all global protocol parameters
 @dev UUPS proxy. Only admin can update. Emits config changes via EventEmitter.

@title Timelock
 @notice Trust anchor. Enforces delay on all governance-approved transactions.
 @dev IMMUTABLE — not upgradeable. This is the security root.

@title Treasury
 @notice Receives and holds protocol fee revenue. Disbursements via governance.
 @dev UUPS proxy. Only DEPOSITOR_ROLE can deposit. Only admin can withdraw.

